WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.000
Clients ask me for features on calls all the time.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.250
This pulls those requests from my calls, logs them by client, and keeps a running tally.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.650
Every morning it checks new release notes against every request, and tells me who asked for what just shipped.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.220
Then it drafts the email. I personalize it and hit send.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.670
By the next morning after a release, I know exactly which clients to tell.
